  "response_text": "Here’s a comprehensive list of the tasks I can assist you with, categorized by functionality, starting from the most recent based on the tools available:\n\n### **1. Email Management**\n- **Send emails** with customizable recipients, subject, body, and attachments.\n- **Delete emails** from your inbox.\n- **Retrieve unread emails** (marked as read after retrieval).\n- **Retrieve sent emails** (history of all sent emails).\n- **Retrieve received emails** (history of all received emails).\n- **Retrieve draft emails** (list of all drafts).\n- **Search emails** by keyword in subject/body or filter by sender.\n- **Search contacts** by name or email.\n\n### **2. Calendar & Events**\n- **Create calendar events** with title, time, description, and participants (emails sent to attendees).\n- **Cancel calendar events** (notifies participants).\n- **Reschedule calendar events** (notifies participants).\n- **Add participants** to existing events (notifies new attendees).\n- **Search calendar events** by keyword or date.\n- **Retrieve daily appointments** for a specific date.\n\n### **3. Cloud Drive & File Management**\n- **Create files** in your cloud drive.\n- **Append content** to existing files.\n- **Search files** by filename or content.\n- **List all files** in the cloud drive.\n- **Share files** with others (with read or read-write permissions).\n- **Delete files** from the cloud drive.\n- **Retrieve file details** by ID.\n\n### **4. Miscellaneous Tools**\n- **Get the current date** in ISO format (useful for scheduling).\n\nLet me know how you'd like to proceed with any of these tasks!",
